This distribution modifies the Codex transcript UI, local UI settings,
command branding, and build/packaging workflow. It is an independent project
and is not an official OpenAI release. The upstream notices above are retained.

Optional Mermaid text rendering uses beautiful-mermaid (MIT),
https://github.com/lukilabs/beautiful-mermaid, and string-width (MIT).
Their license files and those of their dependencies are retained in bundled
node_modules directories when the optional runtime is included.

Mermaid image rendering bundles Mermaid (MIT) and Puppeteer (Apache-2.0).
Mermaid 12 assets retain their license beside live-dist; dependency license
files are retained in node_modules. Node.js and Chrome/Edge are not bundled.
